---
import { Box } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-6 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-24">
        <div class="col-center gap-0.5">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-full fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-3.5 md:w-4 4xl:w-5">
                    <Box stroke-width={2} class="w-full text-gray-800" />
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] md:text-[13px] 4xl:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    Process
                </h4>
            </span>
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                Warehouster’s Land Acquisition Process
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base 2xl:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-4xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                At Warehouster, we follow a proven, step-by-step land acquisition process designed to help businesses secure the right industrial and warehouse land parcels in Chennai, Bengaluru, Hosur, Madurai, and across India. Our structured approach ensures transparency, compliance, and maximum value for our clients.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-4xl flex flex-col items-start justify-center gap-5 pt-3.5">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    1. Market Research & Site Identification
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We begin with detailed market research to identify land parcels that offer excellent connectivity to highways, ports, and industrial clusters. Using data analytics, site visits, and local intelligence, we shortlist locations that align with your business needs.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    2. Feasibility & Location Analysis
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    Every shortlisted site undergoes a comprehensive feasibility study. We evaluate zoning regulations, utility availability (power, water, drainage), soil quality, and environmental impact to ensure the land is suitable for industrial or warehousing development.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    3. Legal Due Diligence & Title Verification
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    Our experts conduct thorough legal checks and title verification to confirm clean ownership records, ensure there are no encumbrances, and validate compliance with local laws. This step reduces risks and prevents disputes in the future.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    4. Negotiation & Transaction Management
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We handle all aspects of negotiation, pricing, and transaction structuring—whether outright purchase, lease, or joint venture. Our team ensures you get competitive land value while safeguarding your long-term interests.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    5. Approvals & Compliance
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    Navigating Indian land regulations can be complex. We streamline the process by securing zoning clearances, conversion approvals, environmental permissions, and municipal compliances, ensuring projects meet all legal requirements.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    6. Infrastructure & Connectivity Planning
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    Beyond acquisition, we focus on infrastructure readiness. This includes planning for road access, drainage, power connections, and logistics connectivity, enabling faster project execution and operational efficiency.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 fade-in-up">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    7. Future-Ready Development
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We help clients acquire scalable land parcels that allow expansion as their business grows. By factoring in long-term development potential, Warehouster ensures your investment remains sustainable and profitable.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>